  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.24,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.939,
      "end": 4.299,
      "text": "It's time to solve one more problem. Now, in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.019,
      "end": 6.379,
      "text": "we are given that a boat"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.879,
      "end": 7.199,
      "text": "covers"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.519,
      "end": 8.539,
      "text": "48 kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.38,
      "end": 10.8,
      "text": "downstream in three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.279,
      "end": 15.699,
      "text": "Also, the speed of the boat in still water is 13 kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.239,
      "end": 18.639,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the speed of the stream."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.159,
      "end": 20.999,
      "text": "Now, can we directly find the stream speed?"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.459,
      "end": 22.159,
      "text": "No, we cannot."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.76,
      "end": 25.379,
      "text": "First, we need to know the boat's downstream speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.099,
      "end": 26.379,
      "text": "We know"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.039,
      "end": 29.399,
      "text": "speed equals distance divided by time."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.859,
      "end": 31.279,
      "text": "So downstream speed equals"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.619,
      "end": 32.919,
      "text": "48 divided by"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.239,
      "end": 33.279,
      "text": "3,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.799,
      "end": 35.579,
      "text": "which is 16 kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 36.519,
      "text": "per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.059,
      "end": 37.319,
      "text": "Done."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.86,
      "end": 39.199,
      "text": "Now we have the downstream speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.579,
      "end": 42.919,
      "text": "Now this value will help us find the required answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.479,
      "end": 44.579,
      "text": "We know one simple rule,"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.2,
      "end": 49.619,
      "text": "downstream speed equals boat speed in still water plus stream speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.059,
      "end": 55.099,
      "text": "Now let us put the given values, 16 equals 13 plus stream speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.479,
      "end": 62.34,
      "text": "After simplifying this, we get stream speed equals 16 minus 13, which is 3 kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.239,
      "end": 63.68,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.08,
      "end": 67.479,
      "text": "the speed of the stream is 3 kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.5,
      "end": 70.239,
      "text": "So the final answer will be option C."
    }
  ],
